  "details": "Basically, add a user status that lets only members of selected group(s) to be able to see the instance you are in.  This could serve as an alternative when a group owner does not set up the permissions for their members to create group instances.\n\nOr if you want to be visible only to individuals in your friends list who happen to be members of those selected groups/individuals while those who are NOT part of the selected would still have to request to join, it would basically be a mix of Green and Orange status (\"Green-\" or \"Orange+\"?  Or call it \"VIP\" status for simplicity).  It would also be nice to be able to make presets for the status.",
